# Canonical author identities.
#
# Each line reads: the name and address git should SHOW, followed by the one
# actually recorded in the commit. `git log`, `git shortlog` and `git blame`
# honour this file; GitHub's own contributor pages do not read it, so the web
# UI still shows what was committed.
